+  # Encoding for mop.r.n:
+  # Original match pattern: 1-00--0111-------100-----1110011 (32 bits)
+  # Variable 'n' is encoded in bits: 30|27-26|21-20
+  # Bit 30: n[4], Bits 27-26: n[3:2], Bits 21-20: n[1:0]
